	"data": "Research: Persistent AI Memory Systems\n\nResearch collected 2026-04-07 — what others are building in the personal AI memory / agent persistence space, and what we can learn from it.\n\nWhat Others Are Building\n\nThe Obsidian + Claude Code Pattern (artoflean.com, 2026)\nClosest analogue to our setup. Key quote:\n\"Obsidian is my second brain. Claude Code reads my vault. When I start a session, it picks up where we left off because everything important is in the vault.\"\n\nSetup: Obsidian (plain markdown)…",
